@startuml
title CloudNotes -- Kubernetes Traffic-Based Horizontal Scaling
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor Browser
component "NGINX Ingress" as ingress
package "cloudnotes namespace" {
  component "frontend Service" as fe_service
  component "frontend Deployment\n2--4 replicas" as frontend
  component "backend Service" as be_service
  component "backend Deployment\n2--5 replicas" as backend
  database "PostgreSQL PVC" as postgres
  component "Prometheus" as prometheus
  component "KEDA ScaledObjects" as keda
}
Browser --> ingress
ingress --> fe_service
ingress --> be_service : /api
fe_service --> frontend
be_service --> backend
frontend --> backend : REST API
backend --> postgres
prometheus <-- backend : scrape /metrics every 15 s
prometheus --> keda : rate(flask_http_request_total[1m])
keda --> backend : change replicas
keda --> frontend : change replicas
note bottom of keda
Horizontal scaling only.
No Vertical Pod Autoscaler.
end note
@enduml
